<p class="x_MsoNormal">It&rsquo;s on the Home page under:<br /><span> </span>Recent Addisions<br /><span> </span>USC Scholarship<br /><span> </span>Cinematic and Performing Arts</p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal"><strong>It&rsquo;s on the Collections page alphabetically under &ldquo;Image&rdquo;.<br /></strong><a href="https://digitallibrary.usc.edu/CS.aspx?VP3=CMS3&amp;VF=CollectionPage" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://digitallibrary.usc.edu/CS.aspx?VP3=CMS3&amp;VF=CollectionPage</a></p>
<p class="x_MsoNormal">All IJPC videos and Joe Saltzman documentaries in addition to other news videos and special projects are available on this site.&nbsp;</p>
