<p class="MsoNormal">Joe Saltzman presents a summary of the study of &ldquo;The Image of the Washington Journalist in Movies and television, 1932 to 2013&rdquo; at <a href="http://www.press.org/events/joe-saltzman-depiction-washington-journalists-film-and-televison" title="National Press Club Speech">the National Press Club</a> in Washington D.C. on Thursday November 13, 2014 at 6:30 p.m.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span>The presentation included a 15-minute video excerpted from the 8-hour and 20-minute video compilation.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></span>
    
