<p><a href="/uploads/files/Ehrlich Hollywood and Journalistic Truthtelling.pdf"><span style="color: #990000;">"Hollywood and Journalistic Truthtelling"</span></a>and<br /><a href="/uploads/files/Facts, truth, and bad journalists in the movies Matthew C. Ehrlich.pdf"><span style="color: #990000;">"Facts, Truth and Bad Journalists in the Movies"</span></a></p>
